title: "ZeoliteSynthesisBench: a leakage-audited benchmark for zeolite synthesis recipe generation and feasibility prediction"
abstract: "A leakage-audited benchmark built on 24,706 hydrothermal records with four outcome labels, three frozen splits, two tasks and seven metric families."
